<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Japan gives Ivory Coast $3.6 mln agricultural aid.</title>
<headline>Japan gives Ivory Coast $3.6 mln agricultural aid.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan has given Ivory Coast 2.25 billion CFA francs ($3.6 million) to help develop food production, the Japanese embassy said on Friday.</p>
<p>The money will be used to buy fertilisers and agricultural machinery.</p>
<p>The government will sell these to farmers and use the proceeds to set up a fund for social and economic development projects.</p>
</text>
